sequenceDiagram
    participant Consumer as Consumer (SOAP)
    participant Proxy as ConsultaConsolidadaRiesgoClienteHN<br/>.proxy
    participant XQ_IN as consultaConsolidadaRiesgoClienteIn.xq
    participant BIZ as consultaConsolidadaRiesgoCliente_db<br/>(Business Service)
    participant DB as SQL Server<br/>CREDITOS_RIESGOS
    participant BURO as Linked Server<br/>[svrpruebas].BURO_EXTERNO
    participant XQ_OUT as consultaConsolidadaRiesgoClienteOut.xq

    Consumer->>Proxy: SOAP Request<br/>{CUSTOMER_LEGAL_ID}
    
    Note over Proxy: Request Pipeline<br/>"ConsultaConsolidadRiesgoCliente"
    
    Proxy->>XQ_IN: Transform Request
    XQ_IN-->>Proxy: InputParameters<br/>{IDENTIDAD}
    
    Proxy->>BIZ: WS-Callout<br/>operation: consultaConsolidadRiesgoCliente
    BIZ->>DB: JCA DB Adapter<br/>EXEC dbo.p_consulta_ONBASE_V2 @IDENTIDAD
    
    Note over DB: Consulta MA_CLIENTES
    Note over DB: Consulta MA_PASIVOS + TRX
    Note over DB: Consulta MA_TARJETAS + TRX (12 meses)
    Note over DB: Consulta EXTRAFIN
    Note over DB: Consulta Ma_Prestamos + TRX
    Note over DB: Consulta MA_OFERTA_PREAPROBADA
    
    DB->>BURO: Linked Server Query<br/>EQX_CONTROL + RecordScore
    BURO-->>DB: Datos Buró Equifax
    
    Note over DB: Consulta RecordB, RecordD, RecordT<br/>(Referencias Activas)
    Note over DB: Consulta RecordPRB, RecordPRD, RecordPRT<br/>(Referencias Históricas)
    Note over DB: Consulta RecordHB, RecordHD, RecordHT<br/>(Historiales de Mora)
    Note over DB: Consulta RecordA, RecordTel, RecordH<br/>(Direcciones, Teléfonos, Cargos Admin)
    Note over DB: Consulta RecordS, RecordC, RecordEvaluacion<br/>(SICOM, Consultas, Evaluación)
    
    DB-->>BIZ: XML Consolidado<br/>(FOR XML RAW/ROOT)
    BIZ-->>Proxy: OutputParameters<br/>{RowSet/Row/Column[XML]}
    
    Note over Proxy: responseData = fn-bea:inlinedXML(Column[1])
    
    Note over Proxy: Response Pipeline<br/>"FujoSalida"
    
    Proxy->>XQ_OUT: Transform Response<br/>{responseData}
    XQ_OUT-->>Proxy: consultaConsolidadaRiesgoClienteResponse<br/>{LOAN_MAINTENANCE + LOAN_ORIGINATIONS}
    
    Proxy-->>Consumer: SOAP Response<br/>Header: successIndicator=Success<br/>Body: Datos consolidados

    Note over Proxy: En caso de error:
    Proxy-->>Consumer: SOAP Response<br/>Header: successIndicator=ERROR<br/>Body: consultaConsolidadaRiesgoClienteResponse vacío
